<title>BELGIUM: TDK to build Luxembourg CD-rom plant.</title>
<headline>TDK to build Luxembourg CD-rom plant.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Luxembourg Economic Affairs Minister Robert Goebbels said he signed an agreement on Tuesday with TDK Corp unit TDK Recording Media Europe SA for the construction of a CD-rom production unit.</p>
<p>TDK will invest 974 million Luxembourg francs in the plant, which will have monthly output of 2.5 million CD-roms and create 80 jobs.</p>
<p>TDK might decide to double capacity in two years if the outlook for the CD-rom market remains favourable.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6815, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
